  "body": [
    "Register for Fall Programming! Session runs now - Nov 8.",
    "PLAY PLAY submenu Programs Private Lessons Adult Camps Summer Camps Book a Court Free30 Dave Bailey Programs",
    "EVENTS EVENTS submenu Calendar 2026 BNP Paribas World Team Cup",
    "ABOUT ABOUT submenu Meet Our Team Contact Us Sponsors & Partners USTA National Campus Scholarship",
    "WATCH WATCH submenu Watch Live Record Your Match",
    "VISIT VISIT submenu Hotel Booking Sustainability Health & Wellness Shop",
    "Home >",
    "Watch >",
    "Save My Play",
    "With Save My Play, capturing, analyzing, and sharing game moments has never been easier. Our AI-powered system gets you started in just a few steps – no downloads or signups, no hassle. Players scan the on-court QR code and are ready to record in 10 seconds or less. No cumbersome app downloads or signups. HD Footage, with AI highlights and gaps removed, delivered seamlessly to your inbox.",
    "This technology empowers players to take their training and performance to the next level. By reviewing high-quality footage with AI-generated highlights, athletes can identify strengths, pinpoint areas for improvement, and make smarter decisions on court. Whether you're preparing for a tournament, tracking progress over time, or simply sharing a great point with friends or coaches, Save My Play gives players immediate access to the moments that matter most—without any friction. It's modern match analysis, made effortless.",
    "This video requires Social Media cookies to be accepted. Please update your cookie preferences to watch.",
    "If you are experiencing technical issues or have questions about your recording, please contact the support team at support@savemyplay.com.",
    "Monday - Friday 7:00 AM - 9:00 PM",
    "Saturday 7:00 AM - 5:00 PM",
    "Sunday 7:00 AM - 5:00 PM",
